s": "eyebrow", "html": "Newly listed", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "e7a8d7a2ed", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h2", "cls": "", "html": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "a98fdc4563", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "lede", "html": "In the first year as a public company, the market either confirms your story or forgets it. Five things go wrong most often.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "347b74ef7c", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "Attention fades after listing day", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "48d5fe5575", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Media and investor interest peaks at the ceremony, then drops unless there is a planned programme behind it.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "abe71a35eb", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "No research coverage", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "a066feacba", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Analysts have not met management, so the stock trades without an independent view of its value.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "fad0fdd45d", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "Retail-heavy register", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "cc45d06180", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Balloting brings retail shareholders. Without institutional investors, trading and share price rest on sentiment.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "202098cda6", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "First results misread", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "4771611c85", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "A first quarterly result with no explanation around it is read by the market, not explained to it.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "b0347bf178", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "Management new to disclosure", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "7186ba1238", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Disclosure rules, quiet periods and limits on what can be said in private all apply from day one, with no rehearsal.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "e01cb8c541", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "How Aegis is engaged", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "334df4b514", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "A monthly retainer built around your results calendar and upcoming corporate events, with one accountable team across IR, media and events. Projects such as an investor day or a corporate exercise are quoted separately.", "section": "Listing day is the start of the conversation, not the end.", "count": 1}, {"k": "87449a1ae9", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "eyebrow", "html": "The quarterly rhythm", "section": "Results week, then the thirty days after.", 