ients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "070f541272", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "b", "cls": "", "html": "Investment community liaison", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "a1972f1381", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "a", "cls": "", "html": "aegis@aegiscomm.com.my", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "bb13263049", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "a", "cls": "", "html": "+603 5023 1848", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "e5f1c6f6db", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "b", "cls": "", "html": "Media desk", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "68236a31a9", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "a", "cls": "", "html": "Media enquiries and contacts", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "baad4dd60b", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "strong", "cls": "", "html": "Or use the contact form and select \"Investor, analyst or media\".", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "6bb183a697", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Aegis runs the investment community liaison and the management engagement platform for its listed and IPO clients. Fund managers, analysts and business media can request a management meeting, a site visit or a place at the next results briefing, and ask to be included in briefing and results invitations.", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "cd32da3b4f", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Briefings and one-to-one meetings happen after the Bursa announcement. Aegis follows the disclosure rules and quiet periods, so nothing price-sensitive is shared in private before it is announced.", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "64414ee691", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h3", "cls": "", "html": "Retail shareholders", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "d9af3c781f", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Retail shareholders of Aegis clients engage through retail investor webinars, KOL investor engagement sessions, investor platforms and shareholder update messages. To be invited to the next session for a company you hold, write to the liaison desk with the company name.", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "5c3ebb6905", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "access-note disclaimer", "html": "<b>What Aegis cannot do.</b> Aegis is a communications firm. It is not a licensed investment adviser, dealer or fund manager, it does not recommend buying or selling any security, and nothing on this site or in client materials is investment advice. Aegis cannot comment on a client's share price or give information that is not in the company's Bursa announcement. For company information, refer to the announcements on Bursa Malaysia and the company's own investor relations contact.", "section": "Management access to Aegis clients.", "count": 1}, {"k": "8d2620d0bf", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "h2", "cls": "", "html": "Ready for your next results cycle?", "section": "Ready for your next results cycle?", "count": 1}, {"k": "925027b344", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Tell us your results date and where your company is on the listing path. We will come back with a programme that fits your calendar.", "section": "Ready for your next results cycle?", "count": 1}, {"k": "3aba7bad7f", "scope": "services/investor-relations.html", "tag": "a", "cls": "btn btn-primary", "html": "WhatsApp us", "section": "Ready for your next results cycle?", "count": 1}, {"k": "bc981983e7", "scope": "servi