dow.", "count": 1}, {"k": "d1141f19c0", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "b", "cls": "", "html": "Equity story misunderstood", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "14c475cb54", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Media or investors read the company differently from management's intent.", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "125f92af14", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "b", "cls": "", "html": "Management caught unprepared", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "d8a5ec6099", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Spokespeople face difficult questions without rehearsed responses.", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "011b73cf24", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "b", "cls": "", "html": "Weak retail visibility", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "9a97dc2344", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "The offer period passes with limited reach into retail communities.", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "06a5670d2f", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "b", "cls": "", "html": "Inconsistent messaging", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "77c3db285d", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Releases, fact sheets and interviews drift apart.", "section": "A listing is a narrow, one-time window.", "count": 1}, {"k": "f6cb9322c4", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "eyebrow", "html": "When to bring Aegis in", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "f344dfe15d", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h2", "cls": "", "html": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "af89c9f583", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "lede", "html": "The campaign runs from approval to listing day. The story, the spokespeople and the approved messages are built in the quiet months before that, so nothing is made up on the spot once the timetable is public.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "6dcd4ce23d", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "pt-na pt-node", "html": "A", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 2}, {"k": "ae4f281df5", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "pt-nb pt-node", "html": "B", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 2}, {"k": "32096c2e0e", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "pt-nc pt-node", "html": "C", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 2}, {"k": "294b58e503", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h3", "cls": "", "html": "Pre-submission", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "7301a89257", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Your adviser is appointed and the submission is being prepared. Aegis learns the business, drafts the story and key messages, maps the investors and media that matter, and agrees with the company secretary who may know what, and when.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "4bb3891c96", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h3", "cls": "", "html": "Submission to approval", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "9ba163c4f7", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Materials built and rehearsed in private: IR deck, fact sheet, Q&amp;A bank, holding statements. Management coached. No public activity until the approval is announced.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "77d5558919", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h3", "cls": "", "html": "Approval to listing", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "c9eb628822", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "The five-milestone campaign below: approval release, underwriting, prospectus launch, balloting, listing ceremony. Then the retainer carries the story into life as a listed company.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "e361104737", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "eyebrow", "html": "Working alongside your advisers", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "69037605ef", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h2", "cls": "", "html": "One communications workstream inside the listing team.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "2c16d0acb6", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Your principal adviser, underwriter, lawyers, company secretary and auditors own the listing process. Aegis runs communications beside them: one point of contact, one approval route agreed with the adviser and lawyers, and releases that follow Bursa announcements, never ahead of them.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "92f8d52644", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Before the prospectus is registered, what a company may say in public is limited by Securities Commission and Bursa Malaysia rules. Aegis plans every release, interview and social post around the adviser's guidance on what can be said and when, so publicity never puts the timetable at risk.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "d528e87cc5", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "Principal adviser and underwriter", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "506fd9f27e", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Timetable, approvals and the sequence of announcements. Aegis aligns the communications calendar to theirs.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "f062275cfa", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "Lawyers and company secretary", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "5b2edea58f", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "Disclosure rules, the insider list and sign-off. Aegis drafts within those rules and clears every release through them.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "63cecca67b", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h4", "cls": "", "html": "Management", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "6e29dd8f60", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "", "html": "The story and the decisions. Aegis prepares spokespeople, materials and the rooms where they will be tested.", "section": "Earlier than the prospectus. Ideally when the principal adviser is appointed.", "count": 1}, {"k": "b518b53499", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "eyebrow", "html": "For principal advisers and underwriters", "section": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "count": 1}, {"k": "78b3d46440", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h2", "cls": "", "html": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "section": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "count": 1}, {"k": "3efe48a25c", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "p", "cls": "lede", "html": "Aegis is appointed and paid by the issuer and works under the principal adviser's publicity guidance. Introduce a listing candidate early, before submission, and the communications plan is built around your timetable from the start.", "section": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "count": 1}, {"k": "51925173fb", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "", "html": "Aegis", "section": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "count": 2}, {"k": "871ad73b7f", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "span", "cls": "", "html": "Deal team", "section": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "count": 2}, {"k": "c795e4d246", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "h3", "cls": "", "html": "What Aegis provides to the deal team", "section": "One communications partner your deal team can plan around.", "count": 1}, {"k": "4c3bf55fef", "scope": "services/ipo-communications.html", "tag": "li", "cls": "", "html": "Communications calendar aligned to the proposed listing timetable from 